    "Scarcity": {"Explanation": "The email emphasizes the rarity of the current low-interest-rate opportunity, stating that it 'only comes around every 30 years' and that 'rates haven’t been this low in almost 3 decades.' This creates a sense of urgency and scarcity to act quickly."},
